  <AltText>
    Artfight of 'Ayn el-Mal'ak and the presumingly short-lived Salt from BGoodKitty. Salt is, as expected, a pile of salt. 'Ayn is a bibically accurate angel with many red, blue, green, and purple eyes. They have six white angel wings. The background resembles the arena where Kirby fights Zero2 at the end Kirby 64.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    I didn't know the OC long enough to give a description of what they look like, but atm I'd say... Coarse-grain salt?
    To be serious, I had too much fun on this one and, surprisingly, learned a lot about how I can better color characters in the future, but it did give me a fear of circles that may last the rest of the day. I mean, it's a trade-off for drawing an angle that I wanted to for 2 years now x3
    Happy ArtFight! :D
  </Description>
